<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CEZ POSTS CZK 7.8 BLN '96 NET.</title>
<headline>CZECH CEZ POSTS CZK 7.8 BLN '96 NET.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech power utility CEZ a.s., the second most heavily capitalised share on the Prague bourse, posted a final audited net 1996 profit of 7.8 billion crowns, according to Czech accounting, versus 8.1 billion in 1995.</p>
</text>
